.tox/
*.retry
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.refs/snapshot-*/
*.qcow2
.ansible/

# Private, machine-local notes: anything *.local.md or under .local/ is never committed.
*.local.md
.local/

# Never commit a filled-in vault; *.vault.yml.example templates stay safe.
*.vault.yml
!*.vault.yml.example

# Generated CI output; never part of the shipped tree.
CI-RESULTS.md
.ci-logs/
artifacts/
artifacts.snap/

# SUSEConnect regcodes / registration secrets — never commit (dereg needs no regcode)
*regcode*
**/reg
linux-system-roles.json

# Editor state
.vscode/
